Now the site-dropped plant: deleting link `site`. In validateAnswer, `location(value.site, path + ".site")` would fail for every link in every JSON case. That's why many requirements (R2, A1, A2, L1) are NOT MET. But A5 cases (`where leaf`) have no links, so A5 not NOT MET.

